<title>USA: BEFORE THE BELL - Giddings &amp; Lewis up on bid.</title>
<headline>BEFORE THE BELL - Giddings &amp; Lewis up on bid.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harnischfeger Industries Inc's unsolicited, $19-per-share takeover bid for Giddings &amp; Lewis Inc sent the target's shares up nearly seven to 20-1/2 in very active pre-opening trade.</p>
<p>&quot;People are expecting a higher bid,&quot; a trader said.</p>
<p>On Friday, Harnischfeger said it would begin an all-cash tender offer for Giddings &amp; Lewis valued at about $747 million, including assumption of debt. Giddings closed Friday at 13-5/8.</p>
<p>Giddings &amp; Lewis asked its shareholders not to act on the offer until its board reviews the proposal.</p>
